      "english": "in that he was without ancestors among us He appertained not to us in our nature.",
      "source": "Proclus Homily 23 On the Nativity in Budge ed.",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:proclus.homily23.budge",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
